{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50508","headline":"宝名 · 崔融","name":"宝名","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"□城烟雨霁，□苑物华滋。\n池连金水白，人契玉山时。\n珠浦荷如盖，铜街树似帷。\n琴歌待明月，丹石有深期。\n（此诗见影印本《新编纂图增类羣书类要事林广记》卷七。\n本诗所缺二字，原本较模糊。\n首句缺字似爲「鼎」字，次句缺字，右边爲「圭」形，左边已难辨认，疑应爲「桂」字。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50508.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50508","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}